# Obsidian vault -- personal knowledge/notes, never belongs in version
# control (this repo is public). The default project-relative location;
# an externally-configured OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PATH lives outside the repo
# entirely and is unaffected by this.
/JarvisVault/

# Graphify (development-only structural graph, see docs/GRAPHIFY.md) --
# regenerated locally in seconds via `graphify extract . --code-only`,
# kept out of version control rather than committed (see docs/GRAPHIFY.md
# for why: this repo is public, and the generated graph.json/graph.html
# are large, low-diff-signal, wholesale-rewritten blobs).
graphify-out/
